# Vercel ignore patterns
# Dependencies
**/node_modules
**/venv
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc

# Build outputs
**/dist
**/build
**/.next

# Environment files
**/.env
**/.env.local
**/.env.*.local

# IDE
**/.idea
**/.vscode
**/*.swp
**/*.swo

# OS
**/.DS_Store
**/Thumbs.db

# Logs
**/*.log

# Test coverage
**/coverage
**/.coverage

# Database
**/*.db
**/*.sqlite
**/*.sqlite3

# Docker
**/docker-compose.yml
**/Dockerfile

# Documentation
**/*.md
!README.md

# Git
**/.git
**/.gitignore